# Stage 5 far layer (factor 3/16 ~ 0.2, y = 0): the Schafberg seen from
# St. Wolfgang - much closer and steeper than bg_schafberg. A long lit
# f west flank rising to the summit (x 362) and a sheer shadowed F east
# face, rock bands as short F/f streaks across the south face, h snow
# patches only round the summit, the summit hotel as a small h/F bump,
# and the rack line as a thin 1 px F diagonal climbing the lit flank to
# the summit (no train). Colours f F h only (art-style 7), no outlines.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = bg_schafberg_sued
size   = 640x150
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
